{"vid":"IetzqR5UQ7M","source":"IetzqR5UQ7M.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":8.5,"txt":"Often unseen, welders are the skilled"},{"t":11.2,"txt":"men and women dedicated to working on"},{"t":13.3,"txt":"all types of industrial, manufacturing,"},{"t":15.7,"txt":"and construction applications. From"},{"t":17.7,"txt":"high-rise buildings to bridges, cars,"},{"t":20.2,"txt":"ships, airplanes, and nearly everything"},{"t":22.5,"txt":"in between, welding is an essential part"},{"t":25.4,"txt":"of our everyday lives. Welding's used in"},{"t":28,"txt":"every single aspect of your life. You"},{"t":30.2,"txt":"might not see it, but it's there. From"},{"t":33,"txt":"the cell phones that you have to the"},{"t":35.3,"txt":"buildings that you're in, even your home"},{"t":37.6,"txt":"to the building that you work in, to the"},{"t":40,"txt":"airplanes that you get on, the car that"},{"t":41.7,"txt":"you drive, welding's used in every"},{"t":43.6,"txt":"single aspect, even though you don't see"},{"t":45.9,"txt":"it. Welding is such a fine art. We"},{"t":49.2,"txt":"utilize welding to join two metals"},{"t":51.3,"txt":"together to create something. And the"},{"t":53.6,"txt":"different types are MIG welding, TIG"},{"t":55.5,"txt":"welding, stick welding, spray transfer,"},{"t":58.2,"txt":"to thermal, laser cutting and joining"},{"t":61.4,"txt":"and welding and all the way across the"},{"t":63.2,"txt":"board, welding's in everything. Today,"},{"t":65.2,"txt":"there is more demand for welding"},{"t":66.8,"txt":"personnel than there are skilled workers"},{"t":69,"txt":"to fill those jobs. There's no question"},{"t":71.5,"txt":"that the world needs more welders. With"},{"t":73.8,"txt":"numerous opportunities to specialize and"},{"t":76,"txt":"grow, welding offers many paths to"},{"t":78.2,"txt":"successful, rewarding careers. I don't"},{"t":80.5,"txt":"know how many times I've heard, \"I"},{"t":81.8,"txt":"didn't even know anything about"},{"t":82.9,"txt":"welding.\" Or I thought welding was dirty"},{"t":84.9,"txt":"and I thought it was for men and those"},{"t":86.4,"txt":"there are these stereotypes that even"},{"t":87.9,"txt":"young girls still have in their mind."},{"t":90.1,"txt":"What I do is I give them an opportunity"},{"t":92.4,"txt":"to safely learn how to use tools, plasma"},{"t":95.6,"txt":"cutter, welder, power tools. And then"},{"t":98.4,"txt":"from that, some of those girls and women"},{"t":100.9,"txt":"have gone on to pursue full-time classes"},{"t":103.3,"txt":"at the college or they're serious about"},{"t":105.4,"txt":"getting a certificate or a degree in"},{"t":107.5,"txt":"welding. So these are future welders out"},{"t":109.7,"txt":"there that, you know, you just have to"},{"t":110.7,"txt":"light the the spark and then they find"},{"t":113.3,"txt":"that passion inside of them."},{"t":123.6,"txt":"Welding has impacted my life in a couple"},{"t":125.5,"txt":"of different ways. First way was in Iraq"},{"t":128.1,"txt":"in 2005."},{"t":130.2,"txt":"I was injured in Iraq by a double stack"},{"t":133.1,"txt":"anti-tank mine. And the only reason why"},{"t":134.9,"txt":"I'm still here is because one of my"},{"t":136.4,"txt":"Marines knew how to weld and we knew"},{"t":138.7,"txt":"that we needed to weld more plates of"},{"t":140.7,"txt":"armor onto our Humvees. That's the"},{"t":143,"txt":"reason why I'm still here. For what Jobs"},{"t":145.3,"txt":"for Warriors, we train veterans in how"},{"t":148,"txt":"to get into welding careers. So, we do a"},{"t":151.2,"txt":"16-week training program for veterans to"},{"t":154.5,"txt":"get them into the welding careers as"},{"t":157.4,"txt":"well as advanced manufacturing because"},{"t":159.2,"txt":"you can't have advanced manufacturing"},{"t":161.2,"txt":"without welders and the welders without"},{"t":163.5,"txt":"the machinists. That's very impactful"},{"t":166,"txt":"for me because I get to see the shift"},{"t":167.9,"txt":"and the change in the individual's life"},{"t":169.8,"txt":"whenever they graduate and they get that"},{"t":171.9,"txt":"job working in the industry that they"},{"t":174.5,"txt":"want to work in. Plus, it's a very good"},{"t":176.4,"txt":"industry to work in. You're getting paid"},{"t":178.3,"txt":"very, very well to be a welder."},{"t":186,"txt":"The American Welding Society strives to"},{"t":188,"txt":"move the industry forward in both"},{"t":190,"txt":"thought and action. From membership to"},{"t":192.4,"txt":"training and certification, the American"},{"t":194.6,"txt":"Welding Society continues to help and"},{"t":196.7,"txt":"support millions of industry"},{"t":198.6,"txt":"professionals. The American Welding"},{"t":200.4,"txt":"Society began about 100 years ago. Its"},{"t":203.2,"txt":"impetus was World War"},{"t":205,"txt":"I. Machinery and especially machinery"},{"t":207,"txt":"for the war effort needed to be"},{"t":208.5,"txt":"reproduced quickly and safely. And out"},{"t":211.3,"txt":"of that effort for World War"},{"t":213.9,"txt":"I, President Woodrow Wilson appointed"},{"t":216,"txt":"Comfort A. Adams, who was our first"},{"t":217.8,"txt":"president of the American Welding"},{"t":218.9,"txt":"Society, to lead that effort. After that"},{"t":221.3,"txt":"war effort took place, they came to"},{"t":223.3,"txt":"realize that welding had many, many"},{"t":225.6,"txt":"different facets and applications in"},{"t":227.4,"txt":"industry. So, out of that came the"},{"t":229.4,"txt":"American Welding Society that brought"},{"t":231.4,"txt":"forth a lot of the welding technology"},{"t":233.5,"txt":"that we see today. When I look at the"},{"t":235.4,"txt":"American Welding Society, I really look"},{"t":237.2,"txt":"at everything that we do around the"},{"t":238.6,"txt":"reason that we exist, our purpose. And"},{"t":240.7,"txt":"our purpose is really to protect and"},{"t":242.5,"txt":"improve lives. And the way that we do"},{"t":244.5,"txt":"that is creating a neutral forum where"},{"t":246.5,"txt":"people from industry and from all over"},{"t":248.4,"txt":"the country even the world can come"},{"t":249.9,"txt":"together and share information and put"},{"t":251.9,"txt":"together standardized approaches. So in"},{"t":254.2,"txt":"that manner, we actually have created"},{"t":256,"txt":"conferences, education and training"},{"t":257.8,"txt":"programs, certifications, standards,"},{"t":260.8,"txt":"exhibits, all that are meant and"},{"t":262.7,"txt":"intended to create a platform where"},{"t":264.6,"txt":"people can have that conversation. I've"},{"t":266.6,"txt":"seen the value of becoming a certified"},{"t":269.1,"txt":"welding inspector because the quality of"},{"t":272.1,"txt":"our craft, welding,"},{"t":274.1,"txt":"is very important. Without having the"},{"t":277.7,"txt":"ability to control a weld in any fashion"},{"t":283.2,"txt":"isn't a good thing. I'm very thankful"},{"t":285.2,"txt":"that I was lucky enough to go through"},{"t":287.7,"txt":"that process, pass that test, and take"},{"t":291.1,"txt":"advantage of all the opportunities that"},{"t":293.4,"txt":"are available to me now. As a board"},{"t":295.2,"txt":"member, vice president, we're able to"},{"t":298.1,"txt":"open the doors for industry, bring"},{"t":300.4,"txt":"counsel to them, and create a unity"},{"t":303.4,"txt":"between those of us that are volunteers."},{"t":306.2,"txt":"We have full-time jobs. Our goal is to"},{"t":308.8,"txt":"help industry better understand. It"},{"t":311,"txt":"allows industry to mentor us, us to"},{"t":314.7,"txt":"teach, train, develop those from within"},{"t":318.4,"txt":"industry so they can take their next"},{"t":320.5,"txt":"step. When I look back at growing up in"},{"t":323.6,"txt":"the industry over the 40 years, I've"},{"t":325.9,"txt":"found that mentors, counselors, those"},{"t":328.8,"txt":"that spoke life into me is what kept me"},{"t":331.3,"txt":"on pace, on track, and brought us to"},{"t":334.6,"txt":"where we are today. The future for the"},{"t":336.3,"txt":"American Welding Society is going to be"},{"t":337.6,"txt":"a lot like its past. A continued"},{"t":339.8,"txt":"evolution of engaging technology,"},{"t":341.8,"txt":"looking to the future for what's coming"},{"t":343.6,"txt":"down the pike in terms of not just"},{"t":345.4,"txt":"welding technology, but embracing"},{"t":347.4,"txt":"technology, how we deliver information"},{"t":349.9,"txt":"and share information with our members,"},{"t":351.8,"txt":"with our industry partners, and with the"},{"t":353.6,"txt":"leaders in the welding industry. So, as"},{"t":355.6,"txt":"we look forward to the future of AWS,"},{"t":358,"txt":"we're going to be looking at the market"},{"t":359.5,"txt":"and how we better understand it. We're"},{"t":361.2,"txt":"going to be looking at what technologies"},{"t":363,"txt":"and information sharing are out there"},{"t":364.9,"txt":"and how we can bring that to the local"},{"t":366.4,"txt":"level for our members. To learn more"},{"t":368.6,"txt":"about the American Welding Society,"},{"t":370.7,"txt":"visit aws.org."}],"words":[{"t":8.52,"w":"Often"},{"t":8.88,"w":"unseen,"},{"t":9.8,"w":"welders"},{"t":10.44,"w":"are"},{"t":10.56,"w":"the"},{"t":10.72,"w":"skilled"},{"t":11.2,"w":"men"},{"t":11.4,"w":"and"},{"t":11.52,"w":"women"},{"t":12,"w":"dedicated"},{"t":12.56,"w":"to"},{"t":12.68,"w":"working"},{"t":13.08,"w":"on"},{"t":13.32,"w":"all"},{"t":13.52,"w":"types"},{"t":13.88,"w":"of"},{"t":14,"w":"industrial,"},{"t":14.72,"w":"manufacturing,"},{"t":15.72,"w":"and"},{"t":15.84,"w":"construction"},{"t":16.48,"w":"applications."},{"t":17.52,"w":"From"},{"t":17.68,"w":"high-rise"},{"t":18.2,"w":"buildings"},{"t":18.68,"w":"to"},{"t":18.8,"w":"bridges,"},{"t":19.56,"w":"cars,"},{"t":20.16,"w":"ships,"},{"t":20.84,"w":"airplanes,"},{"t":21.48,"w":"and"},{"t":21.56,"w":"nearly"},{"t":22,"w":"everything"},{"t":22.48,"w":"in"},{"t":22.6,"w":"between,"},{"t":23.36,"w":"welding"},{"t":24,"w":"is"},{"t":24.16,"w":"an"},{"t":24.24,"w":"essential"},{"t":24.76,"w":"part"},{"t":25.